      en: ["The Dja Faunal Reserve covers approximately 526,000 hectares.", "The Dja River encircles the area for a distance of over 300 km.", "It hosts one of the densest gorilla populations in Central Africa.", "Over 100 mammal species have been recorded in the basin.", "The Baka people utilize over 1,000 different forest products here.", "The average temperature is constant at around 24 degrees Celsius."],
